        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Frank Darabont, Jeffrey DeMunn\n- Organizations: The Walking Dead\n- Products: The Mist, The Green Mile, \"Vatos\"\n- Characters: Morales\n\nFacts:\n- Frank Darabont is a Hungarian-born American film director.\n- Frank Darabont is known for adapting works associated with Jeffrey DeMunn to the screen, including The Mist and The Green Mile.\n- Frank Darabont developed The Walking Dead television series.\n- Frank Darabont created the character Morales for The Walking Dead.\n- Morales appeared in the The Walking Dead episode \"Vatos\".",
