        "original_id": "e24e9147-fcd2-58b9-9299-2ec2ad074b38",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Frank Darabont, Stephen King, IronE Singleton, Andrew Lincoln, Norman Reedus, Steven Yeun\n- Works: The Shawshank Redemption, The Green Mile, The Mist, The Walking Dead, Vatos\n- Characters: T-Dog, Rick Grimes, Daryl Dixon, Glenn Rhee, Merle\n- Roles: director, writer, series developer, actor\n\nFacts:\n- Frank Darabont is known as a director for film adaptations of Stephen King works including The Shawshank Redemption, The Green Mile, and The Mist.\n- The film The Mist was written and directed by Frank Darabont.\n- T-Dog in The Walking Dead was created by series developer Frank Darabont and was portrayed by IronE Singleton.\n- In the The Walking Dead episode Vatos, Rick Grimes was played by Andrew Lincoln, Daryl Dixon was played by Norman Reedus, T-Dog was played by IronE Singleton, and Glenn Rhee was played by Steven Yeun.\n- In the episode Vatos, Rick Grimes, Daryl Dixon, T-Dog, and Glenn Rhee return to downtown Atlanta to search for Daryl's brother, Merle.",
